<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-SUPER 12 RESULTS AND STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SUPER 12 RESULTS AND STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the eighth round of the Super 12 rugby union tournament:</p>
<p>ACT beat Otago 15-9.</p>
<p>Queensland beat NSW 26-16</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal beat Waikato 34-27</p>
<p>Canterbury drew with Natal 26-26</p>
<p>Wellington beat Free State 59-30</p>
<p>Auckland beat Gauteng Lions 63-22</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, points for, points against, bonus points, total points):</p>
<p>    Auckland		7  6  1  0  272  176  4  30</p>
<p>    Natal		   7  5  1  1  266  202  5  27</p>
<p>    ACT		     8  5  0  3  267  219  6  26</p>
<p>    Wellington	    7  4  0  3  266  197  6  22</p>
<p>    Gauteng		 7  4  1  2  224  228  4  22</p>
<p>    NSW		     7  3  0  4  196  171  4  16</p>
<p>    Northern Transvaal  8  2  2  4  191  258  4  16</p>
<p>    Free State	    8  3  0  5  228  275  2  14</p>
<p>    Waikato		 7  3  0  4  160  177  1  13</p>
<p>    Canterbury	    7  2  1  4  163  198  2  12</p>
<p>    Otago		   7  2  0  5  187  259  3  11</p>
<p>    Queensland	    8  2  0  6  180  240  2  10</p>
<p>(Note: Gauteng Lions formerley known as Transvaal)</p>
</text>
